<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Secret Jersey SPb</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #000; color: #fff; line-height: 1.6; }
.container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }

header { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1a1a2e, #000); }
header h1 { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
header h1 span { color: #ff3366; display: block; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 8px; }
header p { color: #aaa; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 30px; }

.btn { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; background: #ff3366; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: bold; margin: 10px; transition: 0.3s; }
.btn:hover { background: #ff4477; transform: translateY(-3px); }
.btn-outline { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #ff3366; color: #ff3366; }
.btn-outline:hover { background: #ff3366; color: #fff; }

section { padding: 80px 0; }
h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 40px; text-transform: uppercase; }

.products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.card { background: #111; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; transition: 0.3s; }
.card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); border-color: #ff3366; }
.card-img { 
    aspect-ratio: 1; 
    display: flex; 
    align-items: center; 
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.card-img img { 
    width: 100%; 
    height: 100%; 
    object-fit: cover;
    -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
    backface-visibility: hidden;
}
.card-body { padding: 20px; }
.card-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.card-price { color: #ff3366; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; }
.card-sizes { color: #888; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 10px; }

.mystery { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #000); border: 2px solid #ff3366; border-radius: 24px; padding: 60px 40px; text-align: center; }
.mystery h3 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.mystery .price { font-size: 3rem; color: #ffd700; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; }
.mystery p { color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 1.1rem; }

.steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.step { background: #111; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px; }
.step-num { font-size: 3rem; color: #ff3366; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.step h4 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.step p { color: #aaa; }

.contacts { text-align: center; background: #111; border-radius: 24px; padding: 60px 20px; }

footer { text-align: center; padding: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #222; color: #666; }
.disclaimer { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: rgba(255,51,102,0.1); border: 1px solid #ff3366; border-radius: 50px; color: #ff3366; margin-bottom: 20px; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    header h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .btn { display: block; margin: 10px auto; max-width: 300px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div>
        <h1>Secret Jersey<span>СПб</span></h1>
        <p>Футбольные футболки в Санкт-Петербурге</p>
        <a href="https://t.me/secretjerseyspb" class="btn">Подписаться на канал</a>
        <a href="#catalog" class="btn btn-outline">Каталог</a>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="catalog">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Каталог</h2>
        <div class="products">
            <!-- Домашняя -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img">
                    <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/secretjersy/Secretjer/main/IMG_0300.PNG" alt="Домашняя футболка">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="card-title">Домашняя</div>
                    <div class="card-price">1 800 ₽</div>
                    <div class="card-sizes">S · M · L · XL · XXL</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Гостевая -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img">
                    <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/secretjersy/Secretjer/main/IMG_0302.PNG" alt="Гостевая футболка">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="card-title">Гостевая</div>
                    <div class="card-price">1 800 ₽</div>
                    <div class="card-sizes">S · M · L · XL</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Ретро -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img">
                    <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/secretjersy/Secretjer/main/IMG_0304.PNG" alt="Ретро футболка">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="card-title">Ретро</div>
                    <div class="card-price">1 800 ₽</div>
                    <div class="card-sizes">S · M · L · XL · XXL</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Специальная -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img">
                    <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/secretjersy/Secretjer/main/IMG_0303.PNG" alt="Специальная футболка">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="card-title">Специальная</div>
                    <div class="card-price">1 800 ₽</div>
                    <div class="card-sizes">M · L · XL</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="mystery">
            <h3>Мистери-бокс</h3>
            <p>2–3 футболки в одном боксе. Случайные модели из ассортимента.</p>
            <div class="price">3 800 ₽</div>
            <a href="https://t.me/secretjerseyspb" class="btn">Перейти в канал</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Как купить</h2>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <h4>Авито</h4>
                <p>Найди нас на Авито и оформи заказ с доставкой.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <h4>Телеграм-канал</h4>
                <p>Подпишись на канал — там новинки и акции.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <h4>Личная встреча</h4>
                <p>Встретимся в СПб, померишь и заберёшь.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="contacts">
            <h2>Связь</h2>
            <p style="color:#aaa; margin-bottom:30px;">Подписывайся на наш канал</p>
            <a href="https://t.me/secretjerseyspb" class="btn">Наш канал в Телеграм</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <div class="disclaimer">Не оригинал. Фанатская версия.</div>
    <p>© 2026 Secret Jersey СПб</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>

